  "title": "How Mobile Inspection Technology Supports Field Teams",
  "summary": "The Second Job for Inspectors at the Desk An inspector can do everything right in the field — check the work, flag the corrections, walk the contractor through what’s left — and still have a second job waiting back at the office: entering it all into the system. For a department that is already stretched thin, that’s where the time adds up. On a normal day, a building inspector or code enforcement officer works through a full schedule of site visits. Between them, the same person...",
